==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Knuckles (Enemy)|Knuckles]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns.
**2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is simple enough, use rushers like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]], [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to easily beat this stage.

